0.3 w 45 484 m 90 484 l S
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 451 Td (Field notes on ordinary days) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 421 Td (A quiet morning begins with an open window. Light travels) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 403 Td (across the desk and settles on the edge of a notebook.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 385 Td (Nothing remarkable has happened, yet the room already holds a) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 367 Td (story.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 337 Td (We often read a place too quickly. A street becomes a route;) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 319 Td (a table becomes a surface. When we pause, familiar things) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 301 Td (recover their details. The worn brass handle, the folded) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 283 Td (letter, the pale mark left by a cup: each asks for a little) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 265 Td (attention.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 235 Td (These notes began as a small practice. Each day, I chose one) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 217 Td (ordinary thing and described it without trying to make it) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 199 Td (important. The practice changed what I saw.) Tj ET
endstream
