BT /F1 25 Tf 45 506 Td (A Measure of Light) Tj ET
0.3 w 45 484 m 90 484 l S
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 451 Td (The same room is never quite the same room. At noon, its) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 433 Td (corners retreat. In late afternoon, the window draws a long) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 415 Td (rectangle on the floor. The furniture has not moved, but the) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 397 Td (proportions feel different.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 367 Td (I placed a sheet of white paper on the table and watched it) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 349 Td (for an hour. First it was bright, then silver, then almost) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 331 Td (blue. The paper did not explain the change. It simply) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 313 Td (received the light.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 283 Td (Attention works in a similar way. It gives an experience) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 265 Td (enough space to become visible. It does not need to improve) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 247 Td (the experience or turn it into a lesson.) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 217 Td (At the end of the hour, I wrote one sentence: the ordinary is) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 199 Td (not a fixed condition. It is a relationship between the world) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 45 181 Td (and the time we give it.) Tj ET
endstream
